{"id":"25929fba481aa4a1","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-np-intermediate.md","title":"Ladner's Theorem","display":"thm-ladner-intermediate-language — Ladner's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-np-intermediate","aliases":["73-thm-binary-np-intermediate","73-thm-ladner-intermediate-language"],"display":"thm-ladner-intermediate-language — Ladner's Theorem","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-p]]","[[73-df-binary-np]]","[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","[[73-thm-binary-sat-completeness]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Chapter 13 bibliographic notes, p. 375 (Ladner 1975a); not a numbered main-text theorem","source_status":"book-bibliographic-statement; local delayed-diagonalization outline only","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Chapter 13 bibliographic notes, p. 375 (Ladner 1975a); not a numbered main-text theorem","legacy_source_status":"book-bibliographic-statement; local delayed-diagonalization outline only","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-np-intermediate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-np-intermediate</span><span>73-thm-ladner-intermediate-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ladner-intermediate-language — Ladner's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d303539c48e08599\" href=\"?note=d303539c48e08599\" title=\"73-thm-binary-sat-completeness\">73-thm-binary-sat-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Chapter 13 bibliographic notes, p. 375 (Ladner 1975a); not a numbered main-text theorem"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-bibliographic-statement; local delayed-diagonalization outline only"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Chapter 13 bibliographic notes, p. 375 (Ladner 1975a); not a numbered main-text theorem"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-bibliographic-statement; local delayed-diagonalization outline only"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NPC}\">\\(\\mathsf{NPC}\\)</span> (polynomial-time, nondeterministic polynomial-time, and NP-complete languages)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ladner\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\bigl(\nL\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf P\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{NPC}\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ladner\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\bigl(\nL\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf P\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{NPC}\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A delayed diagonalization modifies a fixed NP-complete language in stages. Under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span>, the delay can be chosen computably so that the resulting language remains in NP and defeats both the enumeration of polynomial-time deciders and the enumeration of candidate polynomial reductions witnessing NP-completeness.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is conditional; it does not assert unconditionally that an NP-intermediate language exists.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-sat-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"d303539c48e08599","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-sat-completeness]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ladner\\text{-}intermediate\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\bigl(\nL\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\land L\\notin\\mathsf P\\land L\\notin\\mathsf{NPC}\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf P\\neq\\mathsf{NP}","display":false}],"bytes":2166,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-np-intermediate|Ladner's Theorem]]"},{"id":"e23c2f09d27abd49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5a23e63a72e2443c","ebe5483ba604bc90","41d5b79d11297576","d303539c48e08599"]}